      "description": "A real ordered step ending in a concrete working artifact.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-stage\"><span class=\"ds-node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><p class=\"ds-step\">01</p><h3>Inspect the signal</h3><p>Start with reality, not assumptions: stack, process, team friction, goals, and delivery risk.</p><div><span>Working artifact</span><p>Risk register</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-stage{font-family:var(--font-display,\"Space Grotesk\"),sans-serif;position:relative;padding:0 1.5rem 0 0;color:var(--page-foreground,#edf2ef);max-width:23rem}.ds-stage:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:.4rem;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:var(--accent-mint,#a3e8be)}.ds-node{position:relative;display:block;width:.8rem;height:.8rem;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--accent-mint,#a3e8be);border:3px solid var(--page-background,#0b0f10);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent-mint,#a3e8be)}.ds-step{font-family:var(--font-mono,\"Fira Code\"),monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-subtle,#8c9d96)}.ds-stage h3{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,1.8vw,1.55rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.035em}.ds-stage>p:not(.ds-step){font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-muted,#a8b5b0)}.ds-stage>div{border-top:1px solid var(--rule-soft,#26322f);padding-top:1rem}.ds-stage>div>span{font-family:var(--font-mono,\"Fira Code\"),monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-subtle,#8c9d96);text-transform:uppercase}.ds-stage>div>p{font-size:1rem;color:var(--accent-mint,#a3e8be);margin:.4rem 0 0}"
    }
